progressive encephalomyelitis with 
Rigidity and Myoclonus associated 
With anti-GlyR antibodies and 
Hodgkin’s Lymphoma: a Case Report
Linda Borellini1,2*, Silvia Lanfranconi1, Sara Bonato1,2, Ilaria Trezzi1,2, Giulia Franco1,2, 
Lorella Torretta3, Nereo Bresolin1,2 and Alessio Barnaba Di Fonzo1,2
1 Neurology Department, IRCCS Fondazione Cà Granda Ospedale Maggiore Policlinico, Milan, Italy, 2 Dino Ferrari Center, 
University of Milan, Milan, Italy, 3 Aferesi Terapeutica, Centro Trasfusionale, Fondazione IRCCS Cà Granda Ospedale 
